        vendors: "ServiceNow, NICE, Qualtrics", risk: "LMS performance degradation invisible until a whole class cannot submit assignments",
        stack: [{ name: "ServiceNow ITSM", role: "IT Service Management", why: "IT service management used in university IT operations. Incident, problem, change, and knowledge management. Connects the help desk to infrastructure teams and application support.", href: "/vendors" }],
        pitfall: "University IT help desks measure ticket volume and resolution time but rarely measure academic impact. An LMS outage during finals week that blocks submissions across campus has a different urgency than a WiFi issue in a lounge. Build academic-calendar-aware priority classification: system issues during exams and registration get automatic escalation."
