        vendors: "Ellucian, Canvas, Salesforce Education, custom platforms", risk: "Onboarding workflow not verifying student technology readiness before classes start",
        stack: [{ name: "Canvas + Salesforce", role: "Online Operations", why: "Canvas for the learning platform; Salesforce Education Cloud for the student relationship. Together they handle the enrollment-to-completion lifecycle for online programs.", href: "/vendors" }],
        pitfall: "Online student onboarding must include technology readiness verification: browser compatibility, internet speed, webcam/microphone for proctoring, and LMS navigation proficiency. A student who discovers on day 1 that their Chromebook can't run the proctoring software is already behind and frustrated. Send a technology readiness checklist with automatic checks well before classes start."
