        vendors: "Canvas, Ellucian, Salesforce, ProctorU/Examity", risk: "LMS engagement data not accessible to student success team for intervention",
        stack: [{ name: "Canvas Data", role: "LMS Analytics", why: "Login frequency, assignment submission timing, discussion participation, and grade trends. The early warning system for dropout risk: visible in Canvas data weeks before the student formally withdraws.", href: "/vendors" }, { name: "Salesforce Education Cloud", role: "Student CRM", why: "Communication history, advisor interactions, and intervention tracking. When a success coach calls a disengaged student, they need the full picture, not just LMS data, but financial aid status, previous interactions, and support contacts.", href: "/vendors/ccaas" }],
        pitfall: "A high-value data integration in online education: connecting LMS engagement (Canvas) to the student success CRM (Salesforce). When Canvas shows a student has not logged in for longer than the threshold you set from your own data, that alert should create a task in Salesforce for the success coach to call. Without this integration, LMS data sits in Canvas dashboards that nobody checks, and students disappear silently."
